&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the VP of Sales, with your 6 AEs reporting into you. This is a &quot;see it, own it, drive it forward&quot; role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the new business number for EMEA. Carry accountability for&lt;strong&gt; new logo acquisition across the region&lt;/strong&gt;, from qualified pipeline through to closed won revenue&lt;strong&gt;. Drive average deal value &lt;/strong&gt;up through stronger qualification and multithreading, and identify opportunities across our product suite, including transaction monitoring, agentic AI, and ongoing screening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the team. Recruit exceptional AEs, and sell them on the mission, you are part of what they&#39;re choosing. &lt;strong&gt;Coach in a way that builds independent operators rather than dependence:&lt;/strong&gt; develop your team through data led feedback, regular development planning, and a player coach presence on live deals, while giving people the room to work things out for themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the regional operating rhythm. &lt;/strong&gt;Stand up the standards that let the function scale in EMEA: qualification criteria, territory planning, accurate forecasting, and pipeline and CRM hygiene, alongside onboarding and enablement paths built specifically for a new business motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win as one team across functions and geographies. &lt;strong&gt;Partner with Revenue Operations, Marketing, and Enterprise t&lt;/strong&gt;o ensure your AEs are resourced with a quality pipeline, and maintain a feedback loop to Product and to our global commercial leadership so EMEA&#39;s insights shape the wider go to market strategy. Adopt and help refine the AI assisted tools and workflows being built centrally, adapting them to what works for the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent EMEA in the room&lt;/strong&gt;. Engage senior decision makers at fintechs, payment companies, banks, and credit unions across the region, and act as ComplyAdvantage&#39;s voice in strategic regional conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven sales leadership experience, ideally in SaaS, cloud, fintech, or regtech, with the instincts of a player coach.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building or scaling a&lt;strong&gt; new business function&lt;/strong&gt;, including hiring, ramping, and coaching AEs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of instilling strong pipeline generation discipline within an AE team, holding them accountable to self sourced outbound activity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value based selling and qualification rigour&lt;/strong&gt;: you map solutions to real business pain, and you&#39;re comfortable qualifying out when the pain or the champion isn&#39;t there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live and breathe MEDDIC,&lt;/strong&gt; embedding it into the team&#39;s sales process and holding the team accountable to its consistent execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A coaching philosophy&lt;/strong&gt; that develops independent operators, you give people space to figure things out, with the inspection cadence to keep them on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and a fast changing environment: &lt;/strong&gt;proactive, resilient, and entrepreneurial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The credibility to engage senior decision makers at fintechs, payment companies, banks, and credit unions, and to represent EMEA in strategic discussions with global leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;you run the business on clean numbers, forecast accurately, and make territory and prioritisation decisions analytically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to raise the bar and win as one team, demonstrating the cultural attributes needed to thrive in a high growth, collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity, as we want you to have a part of what we are building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Time Off Policy to support a healthy balance between work and life, and overall wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual learning budget to support your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget to set up your home office upon joining.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave and childcare benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance and medical coverage through BUPA, including pre existing conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension contribution through The People&#39;s Pension.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to empower every business to eliminate financial crime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By harnessing AI, a unified platform, and an extensive partner ecosystem, we help customers turn compliance into a catalyst for growth, operational resilience, and enduring regulatory trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 3,000 enterprises across 75 countries rely on our end-to-end platform and the world’s most comprehensive financial crime risk intelligence. With full-stack agentic automation, we help organizations automate up to 95% of KYC, AML, and sanctions reviews, cut onboarding times by 50%, reduce false positives by 70%, and handle 7x more work with the same staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ComplyAdvantage is headquartered in London and has global hubs in New York, Lisbon, Singapore, and Cluj-Napoca. It is backed by Balderton Capital, Index Ventures, Ontario Teachers’ Pension Plan, Goldman Sachs, and Andreessen Horowitz. Learn more about compliance re-engineered for the age of AI at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://complyadvantage.com&quot;&gt;complyadvantage.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4044837002,"name":"Commercial","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":4024097002,"name":"London, UK","location":"London, England, United Kingdom","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app2.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8785716002/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://complyadvantage.com/careers/jobs/8820662002?gh_jid=8820662002","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":6530252002,"location":{"name":"Austin, Texas, United States; Chicago, Illinois, United States; Dallas, Texas, United States; Denver, Colorado, United States; New York, New York, United States; North Carolina, United States; Washington, District of Columbia, United States"},"metadata":null,"id":8820662002,"updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:38:27-05:00","requisition_id":"206178","title":"Senior Product Marketing Manager - Platform & Data","company_name":"ComplyAdvantage","first_published":"2026-09-21T03:58:05-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Senior Product Marketing Manager to own product marketing for our Platform and Data portfolio, the infrastructure, identity, data and entity-resolution capabilities that power everything else we build, from real-time screening to agentic case remediation. This portfolio includes our migration tooling, which helps customers move off legacy systems onto our Mesh platform, and our emerging agentic and AI capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the VP of Product Marketing and be one of two Product Marketing hires building out a newly-forming function. You&#39;ll partner closely with the Product Directors who own Platform and Data, translating a strategically-driven, technical roadmap into a competitive narrative and market presence - work that&#39;s as much about explaining how we&#39;re built and why that matters as it is about a single buyer-facing feature launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also be the primary product marketing voice for our US market, our fastest-growing region and own website content and co-marketing with the technology and identity-verification partners that integrate with our platform, alongside competitive intelligence shared across the wider Product Marketing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We run a structured, phased launch process that&#39;s still evolving - you&#39;ll help shape it as you go, deciding what&#39;s genuinely differentiated and worth a moment, and what ships quietly as a release note.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has no direct reports today. It is a hands-on, individual-contributor role reporting into the VP, with real ownership from day one and room to grow into more scope as the Product Marketing team and the Platform &amp;amp; Data portfolio mature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own product marketing for Platform &amp;amp; Data. &lt;/strong&gt;You are responsible for positioning, messaging, launch execution and enablement for this portfolio, from early roadmap conversations through GA and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tell the data and platform story. &lt;/strong&gt;Translate a strategically-driven, technical roadmap - set by the VP Product and Product Directors into a narrative that Sales, analysts and prospects actually understand: why the platform and data layer matter, not just the products built on top of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the migration narrative. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with the Migration Tooling squad to build the story and assets that help prospects and customers move off legacy systems onto our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead launches end to end. &lt;/strong&gt;Decide what earns a flagship moment versus what ships quietly, and own the launch plan, messaging and positioning brief for the releases that matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own website and partner marketing. &lt;/strong&gt;Run day-to-day ownership of complyadvantage.com content and co-marketing with the technology and identity-verification partners that integrate with our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to competitive intelligence and win-loss. &lt;/strong&gt;This is shared across the Product Marketing team for now - you&#39;ll help build the muscle until we have dedicated coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the US market. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re the voice of our fastest-growing region in company positioning, partnering closely with US sales leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Product without owning their roadmap. &lt;/strong&gt;You influence priorities through evidence - buyer feedback, competitive dynamics, win-loss signal — not through authority. You operate as a peer to Product Directors, not a downstream recipient of their decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI in your own work. &lt;/strong&gt;We expect Product Marketing to use AI-assisted workflows for research synthesis, competitive analysis, and first-draft positioning and content. This is how we work, not an aspiration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years of overall professional experience, including 2-4+ years in product marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a high-growth, multi-product technology company. Comfortable marketing a portfolio, not a single product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a launch or major narrative/content project end to end - positioning, enablement and go-to-market — with general guidance rather than close oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong independence and autonomy, with good judgment about when to run with something and when to escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate technical, infrastructure-level product capability into a narrative that non-technical audiences — Sales, prospects, analysts — can use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a regulated, technical B2B environment, translating product and engineering input into content a commercial audience can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable AI adoption in your own working practice and already using it to work differently, not just interested in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years specifically in product marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, security, or identity markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing AI or agentic tools, platforms, or features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing technical or infrastructure/data products, translating engineering-level capability into commercial narrative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with win-loss and competitive intelligence practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or contributing to company website content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with partner marketing or co-marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At 60 days: &lt;/strong&gt;You understand the Platform and Data portfolio, the migration narrative, and our partner ecosystem. You&#39;ve built working relationships with the Product Directors for Platform and Data, US sales leadership, and the other Product Marketing Lead, and can articulate what&#39;s differentiated in this portfolio and why it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At 4 months: &lt;/strong&gt;You are running launches independently through the tiered model for at least one product area. Website content and partner co-marketing have a clear owner and cadence, and you&#39;re contributing real signal to the team&#39;s competitive intelligence and win-loss picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At 8 months: &lt;/strong&gt;You can point to a measurable result from your work — a launch that moved the needle, a partner motion generating real pipeline, or a narrative that&#39;s changed how Sales sells the platform. You&#39;re a trusted voice in US market planning and operating at a level that could reasonably take on more scope as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity as we want you to have a part of what we are building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Time Off Policy- A work-life balance and focus on our well-being are critical to keeping us performing at our best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual learning budget to drive your performance and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget to set up your home office upon joining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave and childcare benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Insurance to protect your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical (100%), Dental (90%), and Vision (80%) contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Accounts (FSA) to allow you to use tax free dollars for healthcare or day care related expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Perks (Support with student loan, PerkSpot discounts, Pet Insurance discounts, Travel assistance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-Tax transit benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
