&lt;li&gt;Build the instrumentation and attribution needed to make that framework trustworthy, in partnership with marketing operations and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn analysis into decisions. Every significant change should have a hypothesis behind it and a read-out after it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give the wider business a clear, regular view of how the platform is performing commercially.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
