&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product marketing.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate positioning, messaging, and launches into web experiences that convert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand generation.&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver the conversion layer for campaigns, and improve lead quality as well as lead volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand.&lt;/strong&gt; Protect and build the brand experience online, and grow our share of visibility in the categories we want to own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product.&lt;/strong&gt; Connect the marketing site to the product experience, including trials, self-serve, and in-product education.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales.&lt;/strong&gt; Understand what turns web interest into qualified conversations, and close the gap between the two.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer success.&lt;/strong&gt; Extend the platform into customer education, engagement, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People.&lt;/strong&gt; Support the employer brand and the candidate experience on our careers pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT and data.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep the stack secure, compliant, well-integrated, and well-instrumented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience owning a commercial web estate in a business-to-business (B2B) technology, software as a service (SaaS), or FinTech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of measurable commercial improvement: conversion rate, pipeline contribution, revenue, or self-serve growth, with the numbers to evidence it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth across conversion rate optimization and experimentation, including how to design a test, size an opportunity, and interpret a result honestly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of search in its current form, including how AI-driven answer engines are changing discovery and what that means for content and technical strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with modern web technology and analytics, enough to make good architecture and tooling decisions and to hold technical partners to account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading through influence across marketing, product, sales, and engineering stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating as both the strategist and the person who ships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative and future thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; You look ahead of the current playbook and are already testing what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded.&lt;/strong&gt; You think in return on investment, not activity, and can defend your priorities in commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer obsessed.&lt;/strong&gt; You start with the user, and you can describe their journey in detail because you have watched it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data driven.&lt;/strong&gt; You form hypotheses, test them, and change your mind when the evidence says so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong strategic thinker.&lt;/strong&gt; You can hold a two-year view of the platform and explain it clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An excellent executor.&lt;/strong&gt; Strategy without shipping does not count. You move quickly and finish things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influential.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring stakeholders with you without needing authority over them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth minded.&lt;/strong&gt; You seek feedback, share credit, and treat failed tests as information rather than embarrassment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanently experimental.&lt;/strong&gt; The site is never finished, and you would not want it to be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We especially like people who are obsessed by users, journeys, hypotheses, experiments, prioritization, conversion, data, and outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
